  "language": "en",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "The following standards are available on the new portal eresearchcenter :\n\n• ASTM International • DIN • Electrosuisse • IEEE International • INB/Swissmem • ISO • SAE International • SIA International • VDI\n\nFor the first time, this enables the majority of the standards licensed at ETH Library to be used on a common platform. Moreover, unlike the previous Perinorm, the installation of the Adobe FileOpen plug-in is no longer required."
    }
  ],
